Mechanism: If an ACL or filter on the router were blocking 172.16.20.0/24 to 172.16.10.0/24, ICMP would fail in at least one direction; instead both directions work. This localizes the path as healthy across switch1 → mswitch1 → router0 and back to the 172.16.10.x hosts.

